  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safe and quality education for girls and boys in displacement situations in Ethiopia and Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;OO: To contribute to community and institutional resilience in Gambella and Puntland by improving access to quality and inclusive education in a safe and secure environment SO1: to improve access to safe, quality ECCD and basic education in fragile, IDP/refugee camp settings and host communities SO2: to strengthen data collection for creating and disseminating a solid evidence base of what works to enhance access to quality and safe education in crisis-affected environments&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
